.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
.env.production
node_modules
tmp
__pycache__
solver/app/test/
tests/runs/
surrogate/tuning/results.jsonl
tests/tools/qa_matrix_fixtures/_arms/
tests/tools/qa_matrix_fixtures/_generated/
data/
# but keep the surrogate source package that happens to be named data/
!surrogate/app/modules/data/
!surrogate/app/modules/data/**
# ...except its compiled bytecode, which the negation above would otherwise re-track
surrogate/app/modules/data/**/__pycache__/
# ...and the synthetic leaf-dataset generator the test suite runs (its out/ stays
# ignored via tests/data/.gitignore); the blanket data/ rule had hidden it from CI
!tests/data/
!tests/data/**
tests/data/**/__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
powertwin_data
postgres_data
.github/instructions
.github/prompts
*.log
.claude
CLAUDE.md

# CR campaign county reference tables: builder-generated binaries (16 files, ~11 MB gz).
# Regenerate with tests/tools/build_county_*.py (needs /mnt/h ResStock/ComStock parquets),
# then publish with tests/tools/county_tables_registry.py; fresh checkouts and CI fetch
# them from the GitLab package registry pinned by the tracked county_tables.sha256 and
# county_tables.version. They stay in solver/upload/reference_data/ because _load_ref
# and the docker image COPY read from there; only git tracking is excluded.
solver/upload/reference_data/*.json.gz
